      "caption": "Figures and their source notes.",
      "heading": "Course Fees and the 10 Percent Test",
      "content": {
        "kind": "items",
        "items": [
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Single parents and caregivers need work that fits unpredictable hours, so the practical plan is to protect a stable income, build one saleable skill in short study windows and build support so care duties do not collapse when work gets busy."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Start with stable or partly flexible income, add one skill through short sessions and plan backup care before you take on more work."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check current rules and your contract, and look for local support schemes through official channels."
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "Course Fees and the 10 Percent Test"
